{"1343010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Antimatter", "steam_appid": 1343010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Antimatter is a 4X strategy game set in a vast, living, and fully simulated galaxy of immense scale and depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become anything from a humble spaceship captain to a galactic emperor, and everything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade, fight, explore, or rule an interstellar organization. The universe carries on, with or without you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Simulated Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/171843ccfcd7450eded5003dcfe6f613.poster.avif?t=1786404677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/171843ccfcd7450eded5003dcfe6f613.webm?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/171843ccfcd7450eded5003dcfe6f613.mp4?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedurally generated, dynamic, and living universe with thousands of star systems to explore and claim.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire universe is fully simulated, even beyond your line of sight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of corporations, nations, empires, and adventurers may rise and fall as they struggle for power and survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Immersive Space Combats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/80912d71d7824d37963872c1b868b995.poster.avif?t=1786404677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/80912d71d7824d37963872c1b868b995.webm?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/80912d71d7824d37963872c1b868b995.mp4?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is seamless and takes place across millions of kilometres.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in advanced missile warfare using kinetic and energy weapons, supported by complex sensor systems with passive and active detection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage fleets and crews through detailed crew and damage simulation systems.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Colonize &amp; Terraform Planets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/606306ff0a4d5657c3a0b29c646166a9.poster.avif?t=1786404677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/606306ff0a4d5657c3a0b29c646166a9.webm?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/606306ff0a4d5657c3a0b29c646166a9.mp4?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraform entire planets by altering their atmospheric composition, and watch the consequences unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage existing cities or establish new colonies and outposts on any planet.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dynamic Economy with Supply Chain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/7742dc1d9985017c4910a7ed1b83d2f3.poster.avif?t=1786404677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/7742dc1d9985017c4910a7ed1b83d2f3.webm?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/7742dc1d9985017c4910a7ed1b83d2f3.mp4?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A private-sector economy with a fully simulated financial system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce goods at space stations, outposts, and colonies while managing complex supply chains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage trade for individual ships or across all the assets you control.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rule an Organization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the political ladder of a commercial or sovereign organization. Join its ranks, hold a cabinet position, or rise to become its leader.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a complex political system in which power and influence are shared among characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of outposts, colonies, space stations, spaceships, and fleets.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And more...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two galactic civilizations are competing for control of the galaxy, with humanity caught in the middle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land on any planet or asteroid in the galaxy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and customize your spacecraft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a spaceship as you trade, mine, harvest, scavenge, manufacture goods, and participate in the simulated economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete dynamic missions for corporations, factions, and individuals that influence the course of the simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from the ground up to be fully moddable! </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Antimatter is a 4X strategy game set in a vast, living, and fully simulated galaxy of immense scale and depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become anything from a humble spaceship captain to a galactic emperor, and everything in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade, fight, explore, or rule an interstellar organization. The universe carries on, with or without you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Simulated Universe</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/171843ccfcd7450eded5003dcfe6f613.poster.avif?t=1786404677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/171843ccfcd7450eded5003dcfe6f613.webm?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/171843ccfcd7450eded5003dcfe6f613.mp4?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedurally generated, dynamic, and living universe with thousands of star systems to explore and claim.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire universe is fully simulated, even beyond your line of sight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of corporations, nations, empires, and adventurers may rise and fall as they struggle for power and survival.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Immersive Space Combats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/80912d71d7824d37963872c1b868b995.poster.avif?t=1786404677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/80912d71d7824d37963872c1b868b995.webm?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/80912d71d7824d37963872c1b868b995.mp4?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is seamless and takes place across millions of kilometres.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in advanced missile warfare using kinetic and energy weapons, supported by complex sensor systems with passive and active detection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage fleets and crews through detailed crew and damage simulation systems.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Colonize &amp; Terraform Planets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/606306ff0a4d5657c3a0b29c646166a9.poster.avif?t=1786404677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/606306ff0a4d5657c3a0b29c646166a9.webm?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/606306ff0a4d5657c3a0b29c646166a9.mp4?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terraform entire planets by altering their atmospheric composition, and watch the consequences unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage existing cities or establish new colonies and outposts on any planet.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dynamic Economy with Supply Chain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/7742dc1d9985017c4910a7ed1b83d2f3.poster.avif?t=1786404677\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/7742dc1d9985017c4910a7ed1b83d2f3.webm?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/extras/7742dc1d9985017c4910a7ed1b83d2f3.mp4?t=1786404677\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A private-sector economy with a fully simulated financial system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Produce goods at space stations, outposts, and colonies while managing complex supply chains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage trade for individual ships or across all the assets you control.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rule an Organization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the political ladder of a commercial or sovereign organization. Join its ranks, hold a cabinet position, or rise to become its leader.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a complex political system in which power and influence are shared among characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of outposts, colonies, space stations, spaceships, and fleets.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >And more...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two galactic civilizations are competing for control of the galaxy, with humanity caught in the middle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land on any planet or asteroid in the galaxy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and customize your spacecraft.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a spaceship as you trade, mine, harvest, scavenge, manufacture goods, and participate in the simulated economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete dynamic missions for corporations, factions, and individuals that influence the course of the simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built from the ground up to be fully moddable! </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Antimatter is a 4X strategy game set in a vast, living, and fully simulated galaxy of immense scale and depth. Become anything from a humble spaceship captain to a galactic emperor, and everything in between.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/69071237ae414ffaa2aa6ee0643232d7a179be77/header.jpg?t=1786404677", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/2cec595a1776df173091e1b40c65fbf74d6bc426/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786404677", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1343010/2cec595a1776df173091e1b40c65fbf74d6bc426/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786404677", "website": "http://www.antimatter4x.space/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Pentium 4 @1.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD or Nvidia Graphics card with 512MB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</s